<span style="width:100%"><p>Certified Organic Materials</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="6aa441a9-a746-4c6a-a751-f19b4c201025" class="r-1r5voy6"><picture data-rid="15d7f986-38da-42c0-be6c-dcea9f7d6694" class="r-138fcra"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/f3ff9780-3aaf-4dd1-b562-adb5c910ea37?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/f3ff9780-3aaf-4dd1-b562-adb5c910ea37?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/f3ff9780-3aaf-4dd1-b562-adb5c910ea37?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/f3ff9780-3aaf-4dd1-b562-adb5c910ea37" alt="A line drawing of a shield icon with an infinity symbol inside." class="r-10h6as" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="65bcad3d-72e3-425b-ba86-17958bc07e59" class="r-qiu7tz alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>30-year warranty</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="cca35c41-3994-4d17-a080-a3f37db9a66a" class="r-1ckiv5k"><picture data-rid="b6773eee-416f-4bb0-aa4c-43f03f18d604" class="r-q6hrr1"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/1c79e8e2-3010-4fef-afe0-33c73560a332?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/1c79e8e2-3010-4fef-afe0-33c73560a332?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/1c79e8e2-3010-4fef-afe0-33c73560a332?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/1c79e8e2-3010-4fef-afe0-33c73560a332" alt="A line art icon of a circle with &#x27;100%&#x27; inside and a leaf on top." class="r-fojgnu" loading="eager"/></picture><div data-rid="39f7193a-7828-4aff-89ab-27cb43d08a89" class="r-pttl1o alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>100% Organic latex, wool, and cotton</p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-rid="81397dd5-62fd-4cea-9d7a-8a42ab95beca" class="r-18mrzl"><div data-rid="4fd1a868-600f-4d69-b6a6-ba05813b6eed" class="r-1oa2gug"><div data-rid="227a3efc-1651-4e14-b383-53f59db697a0" class="r-g22o9t"><div data-rid="e946bc3d-74f4-426a-b3f6-783ccc537ef9" class="r-bzk9eb alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>Your new home is sealed tighter than any house you've lived in.</p></span></div><div data-rid="6a8870f4-1634-49f6-963d-94a48b5f6f7f" class="r-o2amka alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>That's good news for your energy bill. But it creates a bigger challenge for the air inside your home.</p><p><br></p><p>Modern homes are built to be airtight — keeping conditioned air in and reducing ventilation. That also means things brought inside can linger longer.</p><p><br></p><p>The paint. The cabinetry. The flooring adhesives.</p><br><p>Then, right before moving in, many families either bring in old mattresses that have collected years of dust, allergens, and odors — or add brand-new foam mattresses at their most volatile stage.</p><br><p>Your mattress is the closest material to your body for nearly one-third of your life. Your new home deserves a cleaner foundation for sleep.</p><br><p>Choose organic materials designed for a healthier bedroom from the first night.</p><p><br></p></span></div><div data-rid="403cda98-c0a6-4a9f-89d5-0cd3cc3388fe" class="r-10qcjz"><div data-rid="6ffd178c-d5c0-4de8-84fd-12ddb57ad2b4" class="r-o64hvj alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>It's the last line on the checklist. It's the first thing your body touches for eight hours a night.</p></span></div></div></div><picture data-rid="4f47f939-1b24-4e90-9f11-f3e6c2fae85c" class="r-t6hdm1"><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/44a009dc-18dc-42d5-bc8f-7d7fbcce5b6c?width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/44a009dc-18dc-42d5-bc8f-7d7fbcce5b6c?width=1024" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/44a009dc-18dc-42d5-bc8f-7d7fbcce5b6c?width=1800" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://assets.replocdn.com/projects/92605e33-0819-475f-8c2c-370ef00153a6/44a009dc-18dc-42d5-bc8f-7d7fbcce5b6c" class="r-kb4ub5" loading="eager"/></picture></div></div><div data-rid="74e3166a-7c71-4690-8a24-53365a5f4e95" class="r-1i5j4hl"><div data-rid="5227391a-7919-4275-b2f7-7d6b2bcba475" class="r-19h1agn"><div data-rid="ab35d439-c413-4fa3-a8c7-d5832c465b85" class="r-gk3hzq"><div data-rid="026fd5ba-328a-4bd7-96bc-ff7f98223027" class="r-1dqaaw3 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>96–98%</p></span></div><div data-rid="f60a052d-2a1c-4a26-a466-b2c060202f3f" class="r-1z0eei8 alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>of U.S. mattresses are built with petroleum-based foams</p><p>— polyurethane, memory foam, polyfoam. Natural latex accounts for under 2% of American mattress production.</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="97d05c85-3898-4d26-bb65-8f002239cbc2" class="r-1i83llm"><div data-rid="2cdff0a0-93ce-4bd4-9c52-20656a7c96e6" class="r-1qbif9j"><div data-rid="1fd87e16-8844-46fb-849d-9d8291d46bf6" class="r-l2s2uq"><div data-rid="95978abf-3132-45df-9e22-721de7a1cef7" class="r-o2hcgz"><div data-rid="d4ab7a58-9e8e-481a-94c0-cb2000dfcf02" class="r-fwk7wp alchemy-rte"><span style="width:100%"><p>The industry standard</p></span></div></div><div data-rid="0fb768ed-5510-4685-b692-ce902df386e2" class="r-zmjxjt"><div data-rid="368ee4eb-0bad-42cd-885d-83021c3c52e2" class="r-1ip3jmb"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="